CHANGES IN VERSION 1.0.0
-------------------------

  o First submission of sesameData package.

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.12.0
-------------------------

  o sesameDataList returns a tibble with EHID and Title instead of just the Title

CHANGES IN VERSION 1.31.1
-------------------------

  o Added KYCG.{HM450,EPIC,EPICv2,MSA}.Mask.20261008, built from the
    InfiniumAnnotation v8.2 masks, so sesame's quality mask reads the same
    M_* tracks as SeSAMe2 on all four human arrays (sesame >= 1.31.6,
    zhou-lab/sesame#1).

  o Rebuilt HM450.address, EPIC.address, EPICv2.address and MSA.address
    from the InfiniumAnnotation v8.3 orderings, so sesame reads the same
    probe design table as SeSAMe2. With these and the masks above, R's
    default QCDPB betas equal SeSAMe2's to ~1e-15 on all four arrays.
